{
  "$comment": [
    "基线层 · 基础路由规则 —— agent 只读。",
    "设计要点：只区分「CN/私网直连 vs 境外代理 vs 广告拦截」三类意图。",
    "订阅原文里那些按服务分类的内联规则（Google/Netflix/AI/…）不进入产物，因为基础组只有 5 个、",
    "这些分类全都落到同一个出站，所以 per-service 规则集是纯冗余 —— 粗粒度分类得到同样的路由结果。",
    "只有某类流量确实需要「与基础策略不同」时，才在 custom/ 里为它加组 + 加规则集 + 加规则。",
    "",
    "规则顺序（convert.py 按此拼接）：",
    "  [hijack-dns] → [policy.head_rules 模式档位] → [custom position=head]",
    "  → [本文件的 rules（到 $anchor 之前）] → [custom 默认位置]",
    "  → [$anchor 兜底] → [custom position=tail] → [policy.extra_rules] → final",
    "",
    "$anchor: catchall 标记「兜底走代理」那条，custom 的默认位置就是插在它之前。"
  ],

  "rule_set_base": {
    "geosite": "https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/SagerNet/sing-geosite@rule-set/",
    "geoip": "https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/SagerNet/sing-geoip@rule-set/"
  },
  "rule_set": {
    "update_interval": "1d",
    "format": "binary",
    "http_client": "rule-set-download",
    "bootstrap_dir": "bootstrap"
  },

  "final": "Final",

  "rules": [
    {
      "ip_is_private": true,
      "action": "route",
      "outbound": "Direct"
    },
    {
      "rule_set": ["geosite-private"],
      "action": "route",
      "outbound": "Direct"
    },
    {
      "rule_set": ["geosite-cn", "geoip-cn"],
      "action": "route",
      "outbound": "Direct"
    },
    {
      "rule_set": ["geosite-category-ads-all"],
      "action": "route",
      "outbound": "Reject"
    },
    {
      "$anchor": "catchall",
      "rule_set": ["geosite-geolocation-!cn"],
      "action": "route",
      "outbound": "Proxy"
    }
  ]
}
